/* Resource id 1 (CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID), type 24 (RT_MANIFEST).
   Spelled numerically so the script needs no Windows SDK headers, which the
   mingw cross-build does not have. */
1 24 "shinra-bpsr.manifest"

/* Resource id 2 (`platform::APP_ICON_RESOURCE_ID`), type 3 (RT_ICON) via the
   `ICON` statement, which expands the .ico's images into a group. Explorer and
   the taskbar pick this up automatically; `platform::tray_icon_handle` looks it
   up by this id for the notification area. */
2 ICON "assets/shinra.ico"
